{"id":"e82b4135b6aba06c","group":"56","path":"56/56-lem-disjoint-complete-development.md","title":"不交集的完整发展就是平行收缩","display":"lem-disjoint-complete-development — 不交集的完整发展就是平行收缩","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-lem-disjoint-complete-development","aliases":["56-lem-disjoint-complete-development"],"display":"lem-disjoint-complete-development — 不交集的完整发展就是平行收缩","depends_on":["[[56-df-parallel-redex-contraction]]","[[56-df-complete-development]]","[[56-thm-complete-development-unique]]","[[56-df-parallel-rewrite]]","[[56-thm-residual-transport-laws]]"],"source_section":"§4.2 Exercise 4.2.15; §4.3 Definition 4.3.1; §4.5 Definition 4.5.2, Exercise 4.5.5, Corollary 4.5.9","source_printed_pages":"99–100,107–109","source_ocr_blocks":[120,121,128,129,130],"source_statement_status":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; local-explicit-occurrence-interface","source_proof_status":"local-derivation-from-read-proofs; not-machine-formalized"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-lem-disjoint-complete-development"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-lem-disjoint-complete-development</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-disjoint-complete-development — 不交集的完整发展就是平行收缩"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1e89cffc6791bf08\" href=\"?note=1e89cffc6791bf08\" title=\"56-df-parallel-redex-contraction\">56-df-parallel-redex-contraction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b06f8242a0a4824a\" href=\"?note=b06f8242a0a4824a\" title=\"56-df-complete-development\">56-df-complete-development</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"06c0295d39a97a66\" href=\"?note=06c0295d39a97a66\" title=\"56-thm-complete-development-unique\">56-thm-complete-development-unique</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1f468692d9334725\" href=\"?note=1f468692d9334725\" title=\"56-df-parallel-rewrite\">56-df-parallel-rewrite</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b2ca2cb031a137a3\" href=\"?note=b2ca2cb031a137a3\" title=\"56-thm-residual-transport-laws\">56-thm-residual-transport-laws</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§4.2 Exercise 4.2.15; §4.3 Definition 4.3.1; §4.5 Definition 4.5.2, Exercise 4.5.5, Corollary 4.5.9"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"99–100,107–109"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>120</span><span>121</span><span>128</span><span>129</span><span>130</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; local-explicit-occurrence-interface"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"local-derivation-from-read-proofs; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定上述正交系统，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in T\">\\(s\\in T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\">\\(U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Disj}(U)\">\\(\\operatorname{Disj}(U)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PC}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{PC}_R\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1e89cffc6791bf08\" href=\"?note=1e89cffc6791bf08\" title=\"56-df-parallel-redex-contraction\">56-df-parallel-redex-contraction</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CDev}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{CDev}_R\\)</span> 与有限路径首尾投影见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b06f8242a0a4824a\" href=\"?note=b06f8242a0a4824a\" title=\"56-df-complete-development\">56-df-complete-development</a>，完整发展唯一目标见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"06c0295d39a97a66\" href=\"?note=06c0295d39a97a66\" title=\"56-thm-complete-development-unique\">56-thm-complete-development-unique</a>，平行关系见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"1f468692d9334725\" href=\"?note=1f468692d9334725\" title=\"56-df-parallel-rewrite\">56-df-parallel-rewrite</a>，残余拼接律见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"b2ca2cb031a137a3\" href=\"?note=b2ca2cb031a137a3\" title=\"56-thm-residual-transport-laws\">56-thm-residual-transport-laws</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R\\;(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=s\\land\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)=\\operatorname{PC}_R(s,U)\\land\\operatorname{CDev}_R(\\rho,U)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R\\;(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=s\\land\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)=\\operatorname{PC}_R(s,U)\\land\\operatorname{CDev}_R(\\rho,U)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{src}(\\eta)=s\\land\\operatorname{CDev}_R(\\eta,U)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{tgt}(\\eta)=\\operatorname{PC}_R(s,U)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{src}(\\eta)=s\\land\\operatorname{CDev}_R(\\eta,U)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{tgt}(\\eta)=\\operatorname{PC}_R(s,U)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\Rightarrow_R\\operatorname{PC}_R(s,U).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\Rightarrow_R\\operatorname{PC}_R(s,U).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>把有限U任意枚举，逐一收缩各红项。由于其位置两两不交，每步只消耗该红项，而其余红项残余保持原位置与规则；没有源集红项被复制。故枚举给出U的完整发展。不交位置替换可交换，最终项正是ParRep的PC值。空集时取零步路径。其他完整发展的目标由FD!唯一性相同；也可直接观察每个红项恰好收缩一次后交换收缩顺序。第三式以P_U和β直接给已有平行关系的见证。本引理连接具体残余集与端点平行关系。</p>\n<p>来源为本地Terese (2003) DjVu；本轮已读相关陈述和证明。OCR块按U+001F从1编号，不是物理扫描页；未取得PDF页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-parallel-redex-contraction","status":"resolved","id":"1e89cffc6791bf08","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-parallel-redex-contraction]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-complete-development","status":"resolved","id":"b06f8242a0a4824a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-complete-development]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-complete-development-unique","status":"resolved","id":"06c0295d39a97a66","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-complete-development-unique]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-parallel-rewrite","status":"resolved","id":"1f468692d9334725","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-parallel-rewrite]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-residual-transport-laws","status":"resolved","id":"b2ca2cb031a137a3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-residual-transport-laws]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-parallel-redex-contraction","status":"resolved","id":"1e89cffc6791bf08","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定上述正交系统，$s\\in T$，$U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)$ 且 $\\operatorname{Disj}(U)$。$\\operatorname{PC}_R$ 见 [[56-df-parallel-redex-contraction]]，$\\operatorname{CDev}_R$ 与有限路径首尾投影见 [[56-df-complete-development]]，完整发展唯一目标见 [[56-thm-complete-development-unique]]，平行关系见 [[56-df-paral