有限路径首尾投影见 [[56-df-complete-development]]，完整发展唯一目标见 [[56-thm-complete-development-unique]]，平行关系见 [[56-df-parallel-rewrite]]，残余拼接律见 [[56-thm-residual-transport-laws]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"s\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Disj}(U)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PC}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CDev}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R\\;(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=s\\land\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)=\\operatorname{PC}_R(s,U)\\land\\operatorname{CDev}_R(\\rho,U)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{src}(\\eta)=s\\land\\operatorname{CDev}_R(\\eta,U)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{tgt}(\\eta)=\\operatorname{PC}_R(s,U)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"s\\Rightarrow_R\\operatorname{PC}_R(s,U).","display":true}],"bytes":2514,"backlinks":[{"id":"53cadc7f4a7b8337","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定正交系统。$a=(s,u,t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R$，$\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R$ 且 $\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=s$。路径接口见 [[56-df-labelled-reduction]]；残余传送及拼接律见 [[56-df-reduction-residual-transport]]、[[56-thm-residual-transport-laws]]。完整发展菱形见 [[56-thm-complete-development-diamond]]，不交完整发展与 $\\operatorname{PC}_R$ 见 [[56-lem-disjoint-complete-development]]、[[56-df-parallel-redex-contraction]]，$\\to_R^*$ 见 [[56-df-rewrite-relation]]，$\\Rightarrow_R$ 见 [[56-df-parallel-rewrite]]。$D,z$ 为以下定义的局部对象。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-110","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-lem-disjoint-complete-development.md]]"}],"outgoing":["1e89cffc6791bf08","b06f8242a0a4824a","06c0295d39a97a66","1f468692d9334725","b2ca2cb031a137a3"]}